  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In an electrical circuit drawn below the amount of charge stored in the capacitor is _______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μC</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/21628cfd-ecfc-4400-a6da-2fbfbae6132e.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 165px;\"/>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f5a96414-6e18-4eb8-8cfd-87ec90f5b326.png\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 176px;\"/></p><p>In steady state there will be no current in branch of capacitor, so no voltage drop across <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>  </mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> volt</p><p>Therefore, charge on capacitor <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo> </mo><mi>μC</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
